l for broad application in anaesthesia and sedation. <i>British journal of anaesthesia 120(5):942–959</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.bja.2018.01.018\">10.1016/j.bja.2018.01.018</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/29661412\">29661412</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Eleveld_2018: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
